{"features":[{"feature_idx":0,"name":"en","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":1,"name":"wo","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}},{"feature_idx":2,"name":"non_standardized","type":{"dtype":"string","_type":"Value"}}],"rows":[{"row_idx":200,"row":{"en":"I knew that the woman would take me to a place where there was no pain or suffering.","wo":"Xamoon naa ni jogéen ji dina ma yóbbu ci barab bu amul benn metit.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamone nani djoguéne dji dina ma yobou thi barab bou amoul béne métite.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":201,"row":{"en":"She looks pale and shaken. Mum? I ask.","wo":"Kanam gi lewet mu jaxasoo. Mani ko, Yaay?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKanam gui lewet mou diakhasso. Maniko, Yaayé?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":202,"row":{"en":"Klaus was a heavy smoker.","wo":"Klaus tóxkat bu mag la woon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKlaus tokhat bou mag la wone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":203,"row":{"en":"Then I'll teach you, he said.","wo":"Muni ko kon dinaa la jàngal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMouniko kone dina la diangalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":204,"row":{"en":"Some would succeed, and some would fail, but all would have their stories to tell.","wo":"Ñenn ñi dina ñu am ndam, ñenn ñi duñu am, waaye ku nekk ci ñoom dina am lumu nettali.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnén gni dina gnou ame ndam, gnén gni dougnou ame, wayé kou nek thi gnom dina ame loumou nétali.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":205,"row":{"en":"He knew that he wasn’t about to be in any sort of immediate physical danger, though he had plenty weighing on his mind.","wo":"Xamoon na ni amul woon lenn lu noroon indil yaram loraange ci saasi waaye xalaat yi feesoon nañu ci boppam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamone nani amoul wone lene lou norone indil yaram lorangé thi sasi wayé khalat yi fésone nagnou thi boppam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":206,"row":{"en":"Mary's paintings are a testament to the power of art, and they continue to inspire people to this day.","wo":"Tabloy Mary dañuy fësal dooley art, te ba tay jii, nit ñu bari ñu ngi roy ciy tabloom.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTablo yi Mary dagnouy feussal doley art, té ba tay dji nitt gnou bari gnoungui roy thi tablom.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":207,"row":{"en":"The marlin is too heavy, and the old man is too tired.","wo":"Jën waa ngi diis lool, te góor gi sonn na lool.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieun wa ngui diiss lool té goor gui sonn na lool.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":208,"row":{"en":"To do this, you can place felt pads under furniture legs and avoid dragging heavy objects across the floor.","wo":"Soo ko bëggee def dangay dugal ay pad ci suufu tànki fotëy yi nga moytu diri mbir yu diis ci dër bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSoko beugué def dangay dougal ay pad thi soufou tanki fotey yi nga moytou diri mbir you diss thi der bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":209,"row":{"en":"It's like a switch flipped.","wo":"Daa melni kuñu taal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDaa melni kognou taalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":210,"row":{"en":"She recently has overcome her fat burden and lost some weight.","wo":"Bu yàggul xeex na grees gu bari gi ci yaramam, leegi mingi jeex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBou yaggoul khekh na graisse bou bari gui thi yaramam légui moungui diékh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":211,"row":{"en":"When we work with this mindset, we approach our tasks with a sense of reverence and respect.","wo":"Sunu jàppee noonu sunu liggéey, danuy mëna jàppee sunu liggéey ni xeetu jaamu Yàlla ak sargal ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnou diapé nonou sougnou liguey daniouy meuna diapé sougnou liguey ni khettou diamou Yalla ak sargal ko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":212,"row":{"en":"She turned to run, but the man grabbed her arm. I said get out of here! he shouted.","wo":"Ndaw si wëlbatiku bëgga daw, waa ji jàpp loolu ni ko, Wax naala nga joge fii!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdaw si weulbatikou beuga daw, wa dji diap lolou niko, wakh nala nga diogué fi!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":213,"row":{"en":"The awards are entirely subjective, not formed through consultation, and aren't necessarily backed up with facts.","wo":"Neexal yi jaarale wuñu ko ci yoon ngir jox leen ñi ko yelloo, lalu wuñu ci dara lu leer.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNekhal yii diaralé wugnu ko thi yone nguir diokh léne gni ko yello, lalou wugnu thi dara lou leer.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":214,"row":{"en":"In some cases, UTIs can lead to more serious problems, such as kidney infections.","wo":"Ci ñenn, UTI yi mën nañu indi jafe-jafe yu gëna tar, ci misaal su sudee ba jàpp rein yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi gnene, UTI yi meun nagnou indi diafé diafé you geuna tarr, thi misal sou dé ba diap rein yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":215,"row":{"en":"Salesperson: No problem. We'll get started on that right away.","wo":"Jaaykat bi: Loolu dunu boole. Noo ngi koy def leegi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiaykat bi lolou dougnou boolé noniou ngui koy def légui\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":216,"row":{"en":"The area has been inhabited by humans for thousands of years, and the first known civilization in Sudan was the Kingdom of Kush, which flourished from around 750 BC to 350 AD.","wo":"Bi fa nit ñi tàmbalee dëkk ak leegi def ay junniy at, te civilisasioŋ bi fa njëkka am ci Sudan mooy Royaume bu Kush, muy nguur gi daan doxal ci diggante 750 balaa JC ba 350 ginaaw JC.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi fa nitt gni tambalé deuk ak légui def ay junniy att, té civilisations bi fa ndieukka ame thi soudan moy royaume bou kush, mouy ngour gui dane dokhale thi digganté 750 balaa JC ba 350 guinaw JC.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":217,"row":{"en":"Sign up for our service today and start saving money on all your Amazon purchases!","wo":"Aboneel ci sunu serwiis tay, nga tàmbali sakkanal xaalis ci lépp loo jënd ci Amazon!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAbonél si sounou serwiis tayé, nga tambali sakkanal khaliss si lép lo dieund si Amazon!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":218,"row":{"en":"One way is to use a machine that filters the water.","wo":"Benn ci mbir yooyu mooy wut machine buy segg ndox mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi mbir yoyou moy wout machine bouy seugg ndokh mi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":219,"row":{"en":"George and Lennie are both dreamers.","wo":"George ak Lennie dañuy dundee yaakaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGeorge ak Lennie daniouy doundé yakar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":220,"row":{"en":"But when she gets to the theater, she realizes that she has forgotten her lines.","wo":"Waaye bi yeggee ci teyaatar ci la fàttaliku ni indaalewul ay mbindam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé bi yégé thi teyaatar thi la fattalikou ni indaléwoul ay mbindam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":221,"row":{"en":"Old Man: I agree. But I'm also worried about how it's going to affect my business.","wo":"Ku mag ki: Nangu naa. Waaye lima gëna jaaxal nimu naree yàq sama liggéey.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou mag ki: Nangou naa wayé lima geuna diahal nimou naré yak sama liguey.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":222,"row":{"en":"One day, a young woman named Amara was walking through the market when she saw the blind beggar.","wo":"Mu am benn bis benn xale bu jigéen bu tudd Amara bu doon dem marse daal di gis yalwaankat bu silmaxa bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou ame bene biss bene khalé bou djiguéne bou toudde Amara bou done dem marché dale di guiss yalwanekate bou silmakha bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":223,"row":{"en":"The director used light and shadow to create a sense of atmosphere that was really effective.","wo":"Realisatër bi dafa jëfandikoo leer ak lëndëm ngir defar ci lu rafet te jàlloon na.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRealisateur bi dafa dieufandiko leer ak leundeum nguir defar si lou rafet té dialone na.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":224,"row":{"en":"This is because we are all created in God's image, and God is the essence of rationality and order.","wo":"Lu ko waral mooy Yàlla daf ñu bindee ci leeram, te Yàlla xel di yoon wu jub.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLiko waral moy Yalla daf gnou bindé ci leeram té Yalla khel di yone wou dioub.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":225,"row":{"en":"We talked for a few minutes before the bell rang for class to start.","wo":"Nu waxtaan ab diir balaa ñuy sone kuur bi tàmbali.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNagnou wakhtane ab diir bala gnouy soné cour bi tambali.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":226,"row":{"en":"When you look at one of your sculptures, you are not seeing the world as it is.","wo":"Soo xoolee benn ci say yatteef, gisoo àdduna bi ci nimu mel dëgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo kholé bene si say yatef guisso addouna bi si nimou mel deugue.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":227,"row":{"en":"Software companies created programs that could run on PCs, and these programs quickly became essential tools for PC users.","wo":"Defarkati losisel yi ñoo defar prograam yiy daw ci PC yi, prograam yooyu dem ba nekk lu jëfandikukat yi mënul baña am.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDefarkati logiciel yi nio defar programme yiy daw si PC yi programme yoyou dem ba neuk lou dieufandikoukat yi meunoul bagnia ame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":228,"row":{"en":"But how would you get the sand out of the water?","wo":"Waaye naka ngay dindee suuf si ci ndax mi?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé naka ngay dindé souf si thi ndakh mi ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":229,"row":{"en":"The production of plastic bags requires a great deal of energy, and it also releases harmful pollutants into the environment.","wo":"Defar sac plastik dafay laaj energie bu bari, rax ci dolli li muy génne ci mbir yu mëna jural mbindeef yi loraange daa bari.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDéfar sac plastique dafay ladj énergie bou bari rk thi dolli limouy guéné thi mbir you meuna dioural mbindééf yi loraangé da bari.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":230,"row":{"en":"When we live in accordance with our true nature, we are able to experience peace and harmony.","wo":"Sudee noo ngi dundu nu méngoo ak linu doon dëgg, danuy am jàmm ak xel mu dal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou dé gnoungui doundou niou mengoo ak liniou done deugg daniouy ame diam ak hel mou dale\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":231,"row":{"en":"Cousin 1: We need your help with a decision.","wo":"Cousin 1: Danu soxla woon sa xalaat ci benn dogal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nCousin 1: daniou sokhla wone sa khalaate thi beneu dogal\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":232,"row":{"en":"One of the biggest problems with vigilante justice is that it is typically not done in a fair and impartial manner.","wo":"Li gëna nekk ay jafe-jafe ci doxalal sa bopp yoon mooy anam wi ñu koy defee du yamale ñépp te du tëddee njaaxaanaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi geuna nekk ay diafé diafé si dokhalal sa bopp yoon moy anam wi gnou koy défé dou yamalé nieup té dou teudéé ndiaakhanaay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":233,"row":{"en":"We can also choose to buy from businesses that do not support animal cruelty and to support organizations that work to protect animals.","wo":"Mën nanu jël dogal di jëndee ci entrepriis yuy xeex ñiy def baayima yi yëfi soxor ak di jàppale mbootaay yi aar baayima yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagn dieul dogal di dieundé ci entreprise yuy khékh gniiy def bayima yi yeufi sokhor ak di diapalé mbootaay yii aar bayima yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":234,"row":{"en":"Ask yourself if you are really making an informed decision, or if you are simply letting your biases cloud your judgment.","wo":"Xoolaatal bu baax ndax xalaat nga bu baax balaa ngay jël benn dogal, nga moytu yenn yi dila nax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKholaatal bou bakh ndakh khalat nga bou bakh bala ngay dieul ben dogal, nga moytou yenn yi dila nakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":235,"row":{"en":"The toddler reached out and touched a leaf.","wo":"Perantal dem daal di laal benn xob.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPérantal dem daldi lal beneu khob.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":236,"row":{"en":"Patient: Thank you, doctor. That wasn't so bad.","wo":"Malaad bi: Jërëjëf doktër. Mettiwul noonu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMalaad bi: Dieureudieuf docteur mettiwoul nonou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":237,"row":{"en":"soccer","wo":"kunu wóoluwul ñàkk a wóolu","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nkougnou woolouwoul gnaka woolou\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":238,"row":{"en":"Walk hundreds of miles through possibly dangerous territory?","wo":"Dox téemiri kilomeetar ci réew mu mëna am fitna?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDokh tééméri kilomètre thi réw mou meuna ame fitna ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":239,"row":{"en":"Children can use dolls to act out stories, explore different roles, and learn about the world around them.","wo":"Xale mën nañu jëfandikoo ay puppe ngir nettali ay léeb, jouer ay role yu wuute ak jàngaale li leen wër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé meun nagnou dieufandiko ay poupé nguir netali ay lééb, jouer ay role you wouté ak diangalé li léne weur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":240,"row":{"en":"The amount of rain that falls in a rainstorm is measured in inches.","wo":"Bariwaayu taw biy wàcci ñu ngi koy nattee ci pouce.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBarriwayou taw biiy wathi gnou ngui koy naté thi pousse.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":241,"row":{"en":"They are also called to love their neighbors as themselves.","wo":"Dañu leen sant ñu bëgg seen dëkkandoo niñu bëggee seen bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnou léne sant gnou beug seen deukandoo nignou beugué seen bopp.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":242,"row":{"en":"They are even prohibited from receiving their loved ones’ remains.","wo":"Dañu dem sax ba tere leen jot ci seen néewu mbokk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnou dem sakh ba teure léne diote si séne néwou mbok.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":243,"row":{"en":"The website was full of ads for all sorts of products, all of which were supposedly on sale.","wo":"Sitweb baa ngi fees dell ak ay yëgley produits yu bari, yépp di wax ci njaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSite web ba ngui fess dell ak ay yeuglé produits you bari yeup di wakh si ndiaay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":244,"row":{"en":"Elephants live in herds and are very social animals.","wo":"Ñay yi dundu mbooloo lañuy dundu, te dañuy jàppalante.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ngnay yi doundou mbollo lagnouy doundou té dagnouy diappalanté\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":245,"row":{"en":"Just talking about policies, candidates, and election dates with family and friends is productive.","wo":"Di waxtaan ak say xarit ci wàllu politik, ci kàndidaa yi ak ci eleksioŋ rek a am njariñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDi wakhtane ak say kharit si wallou politique, si candidats yi ak si elections rek a am ndiarigne.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":246,"row":{"en":"Granddaughter: I guess so.","wo":"Sët bu jigéen bi: Yaa ko laal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSett bou djiguéne bii: Yako laal\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":247,"row":{"en":"They form strong bonds with each other and care for their young.","wo":"Dañuy nas diggante yu dëgër seen biir, di toppatoo ñu ndaw ñi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDagnouy nass diguenté you deugeur seen biir di topato gnou ndaw gni.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":248,"row":{"en":"Compared to September, category sales increased by eight percent.","wo":"Buñu ko méngale ak sàttumbar, njaayum kategori mi yokk na 8 pursaa.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBouniou ko mengalé ak sattoumbar ndiaayoum catégorie bi yok na 8 pourcent.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":249,"row":{"en":"* If you're not sure how to trim your dog's nails, ask your veterinarian or a groomer for help.","wo":"* Sudee xamoo nooy daggee sa wewi xaj, laajal sa veterineer wala yarkatu xaj.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé khamoo noy dagé sa wéwi khadj, ladjal sa veterinaire wala yarkatou khadj.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":250,"row":{"en":"Another advantage of open-air markets is the variety of goods and services available.","wo":"Meneen mbir mu am solo ci marse luuma yi mooy barina ay mbir yoo fa mëna amee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeneune mbir mou am solo thi marché louma yi moy barina ay mbir yoo fa meuna amé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":251,"row":{"en":"I tried to uninstall it, but it wouldn't let me.","wo":"Jéem naa ko dindi, waaye nanguwul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjéme nako dindi wayé nangouwoul.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":252,"row":{"en":"The dog was dirty and skinny, but it had a friendly face.","wo":"Xaj baa ngi